 "title": "nonce泄密",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 137.19,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "第二处随机性，在签名里。",
   "spoken": "第二处随机性，在签名里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.072,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "ECDSA 每次签名，都需要一个一次性的数，叫 k，也就是 nonce。",
   "spoken": "ECDSA 每次签名，都需要一个一次性的数，叫 k，也就是 nonce。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.892,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 4.99,
   "speechEnd": 9.525
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "k 出错有三种情况。第一种，两次签名用了同一个 k。",
   "spoken": "k 出错有三种情况。第一种，两次签名用了同一个 k。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.56,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 10.658,
   "speechEnd": 15.727
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "攻击者还需要别的东西吗？",
   "spoken": "攻击者还需要别的东西吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.78,
   "dur": 2.736,
   "speechStart": 16.878,
   "speechEnd": 18.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "不需要。两个签名和两个消息哈希都是公开的，直接解方程，就得到私钥。",
   "spoken": "不需要。两个签名和两个消息哈希都是公开的，直接解方程，就得到私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.016,
   "dur": 7.392,
   "speechStart": 20.114,
   "speechEnd": 26.576
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "打个比方。nonce 像一块每次都换的遮布，盖在私钥上面。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。nonce 像一块每次都换的遮布，盖在私钥上面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.628,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 27.726,
   "speechEnd": 32.176
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "同一块布用了两次，两次结果一对比，布就被消掉，私钥就显出来了。",
   "spoken": "同一块布用了两次，两次结果一对比，布就被消掉，私钥就显出来了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.248,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 33.346,
   "speechEnd": 38.834
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "比方的局限是，真实过程是解方程。而且下面两种情况，一次对比无法解决。",
   "spoken": "比方的局限是，真实过程是解方程。而且下面两种情况，一次对比无法解决。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.876,
   "dur": 7.392,
   "speechStart": 39.974,
   "speechEnd": 46.436
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第二种，k 有偏置，比如高几位总是 0。收集足够多签名，用格方法就能恢复私钥。",
   "spoken": "第二种，k 有偏置，比如高几位总是 0。收集足够多签名，用格方法就能恢复私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 47.488,
   "dur": 8.4,
   "speechStart": 47.586,
   "speechEnd": 55.048
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第三种最糟。k 可以由公开数据算出，那么单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "spoken": "第三种最糟。k 可以由公开数据算出，那么单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 56.108,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 56.206,
   "speechEnd": 62.215
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "标准早有解法，叫 RFC 6979。它用私钥和消息，确定性地派生 k，可以消除前两种风险。",
   "spoken": "标准早有解法，叫 RFC 六九七九。它用私钥和消息，确定性的派生 k，可以消除前两种风险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 63.264,
   "dur": 9.696,
   "speechStart": 63.362,
   "speechEnd": 72.109
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "EdDSA 标准也要求，nonce 由私钥的秘密部分派生。风险来自偏离标准的实现。",
   "spoken": "EdDSA 标准也要求，nonce 由私钥的秘密部分派生。风险来自偏离标准的实现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 73.18,
   "dur": 7.656,
   "speechStart": 73.278,
   "speechEnd": 80.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "三个案例。2013 年 8 月，Android 的随机数缺陷，让不同签名用了相同的 nonce，多款比特币钱包受影响。",
   "spoken": "三个案例。2013 年 8 月，Android 的随机数缺陷，让不同签名用了相同的 nonce，多款比特币钱包受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 81.056,
   "dur": 9.384,
   "speechStart": 81.154,
   "speechEnd": 89.616
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "2019 年，一项研究用格方法，恢复出数百个比特币私钥，和数十个以太坊私钥。",
   "spoken": "2019 年，一项研究用格方法，恢复出数百个比特币私钥，和数十个以太坊私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 90.66,
   "dur": 7.512,
   "speechStart": 90.758,
   "speechEnd": 97.341
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "2026 年 6 月，Cardano 钱包 SecondFi 的 Android 版，用公开交易数据派生 nonce，漏掉了秘密部分。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 6 月，Cardano 钱包 SecondFi 的 Android 版，用公开交易数据派生 nonce，漏掉了秘密部分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 98.392,
   "dur": 8.688,
   "speechStart": 98.49,
   "speechEnd": 106.228
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "nonce 人人可算，单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "spoken": "nonce 人人可算，单个签名就能反推私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 107.3,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 107.398,
   "speechEnd": 110.945
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "374 个钱包被盗，约 1600 万 ADA，约 240 万美元。这是官方口径，SlowMist 的估计更高。",
   "spoken": "374 个钱包被盗，约 1600 万 ADA，约 240 万美元。这是官方口径，SlowMist 的估计更高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 111.984,
   "dur": 9.432,
   "speechStart": 112.082,
   "speechEnd": 120.591
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "硬件钱包签名走另一条路径，不受影响。",
   "spoken": "硬件钱包签名走另一条路径，不受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 121.636,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 121.734,
   "speechEnd": 124.936
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "教训是，nonce 必须确定性派生，并包含私钥的秘密材料。封装层要做已知答案测试，不能只信任底层库。",
